		(uuid "5f9f75a5-5dd7-43b9-b494-8b5dda41c8a6")
	)
	(text "Connector 1's own P0.8-P0.31 exactly, no spares on this side (all this domain's"
		(at 340.36 60.96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "dada3c37-99fc-47dc-9966-9accf880e184")
	)
	(text "own spare headroom lives on opto-intan's own second package)."
		(at 340.36 66.03999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "c6394d3c-80d0-47a7-a79c-b55a8e99a620")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 340.36 71.12 0)
