		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a0f928d4-89af-4a6d-8a13-c4c1ace790a3")
	)
	(text "through F4 and D3 (0.38-0.45V of drop, so 4.55-4.62V) and VF's worst case is"
